  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Brand introduction</strong>: </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Welcome to <a href=\"https://glowastica.com/\">Glowastica</a>, where we're dedicated to helping men and women of all ages to optimize their skin care routines and achieve the brighter, tighter and younger looking skin they've always wanted. Our goal is to provide natural and non-surgical skincare products, information and solution to help our customers achieve a gorgeous and youthful complexion.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product description:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The rounded&nbsp;design of the Glowastica face lift&nbsp;tool takes on the shape of your facial curves, making it the&nbsp;<strong>perfect tool for</strong>&nbsp;<strong data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment=\"1\">sculpting that sharp, defined jaw and neckline.</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Glowastica&nbsp;utilizes&nbsp;<strong>LED light therapy</strong>&nbsp;which stimulates the growth of new skin cells and the production of fresh collagen!&nbsp;<strong>Red light therapy</strong>&nbsp;in particular assists with reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles!&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The Glowastica face shaper tool&nbsp;also uses&nbsp;<strong>EMS</strong>&nbsp;<strong>microcurrent and ultrasonic vibrations.&nbsp;</strong>This will&nbsp;<strong>stimulate blood flow</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>enhance lymphatic drainage</strong> to give your skin a natural facelift and that extra &ldquo;wow&rdquo; factor.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li data-visibility-product-tags=\"\" data-visibility-product-types=\"\" data-visibility-collection=\"\" data-visibility-product=\"8119400399145\" data-visibility-type=\"product\">Sculpts, Tightens and Lifts Face</li>\r\n<li data-visibility-product-tags=\"\" data-visibility-product-types=\"\" data-visibility-collection=\"\" data-visibility-product=\"8119400399145\" data-visibility-type=\"product\">Smooth Out Fine Lines and Wrinkles</li>\r\n<li data-visibility-product-tags=\"\" data-visibility-product-types=\"\" data-visibility-collection=\"\" data-visibility-product=\"8119400399145\" data-visibility-type=\"product\">Decrease Puffiness</li>\r\n<li data-visibility-product-tags=\"\" data-visibility-product-types=\"\" data-visibility-collection=\"\" data-visibility-product=\"8119400399145\" data-visibility-type=\"product\">Boost Skin's Glow</li>\r\n<li data-visibility-product-tags=\"\" data-visibility-product-types=\"\" data-visibility-collection=\"\" data-visibility-product=\"8119400399145\" data-visibility-type=\"product\">Fade Skin Blemishes</li>\r\n<li data-visibility-product-tags=\"\" data-visibility-product-types=\"\" data-visibility-collection=\"\" data-visibility-product=\"8119400399145\" data-visibility-type=\"product\">Amplifies Serum</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>Payment terms: </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We accept Paypal + all major credit cards</p>",
